{"title":"2021 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Just_2_min!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Just 2 min!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Punxsutawney_Phil\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Punxsutawney Phil</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn_(Logarithmic_Manipulation)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn (Logarithmic Manipulation)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Hawk_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Hawk Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/9/8a93eb4b50cbbb0b051fa1401e2e58d5ab02d33e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\log_2 80}{\\log_{40}2}-\\frac{\\log_2 160}{\\log_{20}2}?\\]\" width=\"149\" height=\"42\" /><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601678842e7e593b100fa0ddeb7bb056fe626233.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }0 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) }1 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) }\\frac54 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) }2 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) }\\log_2 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"394\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/a/ecaa739cc3d887ba1766dc6a6e1c4f7ff7eba881.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\log_{2}{80}}{\\log_{40}{2}}-\\frac{\\log_{2}{160}}{\\log_{20}{2}}\\]\" width=\"140\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/b/f0b7591b43bf77f6425bd79a2e1908b97c5991af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{40}{2}=\\frac{1}{\\log_{2}{40}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"128\" height=\"41\" />, and similarly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/f/cbfe5c3db5e5b532c30eeae811fc1c4c98fbf45b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{20}{2}=\\frac{1}{\\log_{2}{20}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"128\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/a/8eae9612f64d6e8ddf97686a8e74c8309b6d6ef7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= \\log_{2}{80}\\cdot \\log_{2}{40}-\\log_{2}{160}\\cdot \\log_{2}{20}\\]\" width=\"283\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/6/736771a0eba460514a82ed669ee1b1d9855e7047.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=(\\log_{2}{4}+\\log_{2}{20})(\\log_{2}{2}+\\log_{2}{20})-(\\log_{2}{8}+\\log_{2}{20})\\log_{2}{20}\\]\" width=\"478\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/2/4b21abc78fc7647612ff5c9ecfd62e29c9773171.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=(2+\\log_{2}{20})(1+\\log_{2}{20})-(3+\\log_{2}{20})\\log_{2}{20}\\]\" width=\"388\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Expanding, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/2/be239702516f13b4dd8831ce1f08e672926ba2ca.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2+2\\log_{2}{20}+\\log_{2}{20}+(\\log_{2}{20})^2-3\\log_{2}{20}-(\\log_{2}{20})^2\\]\" width=\"446\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>All the log terms cancel, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/0/e3052f8450ae02ed5d0a6413ef6d3618a4fa154e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\implies\\boxed{\\text{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"96\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~ SoySoy4444\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Just_2_min.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Just_2_min!)\">Video Solution (Just 2 min!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Just 2 min!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/jQaB8k9lZNc\">https://youtu.be/jQaB8k9lZNc</a>\n</p><p><i>~Education, the Study of Everything</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Punxsutawney_Phil\">Video Solution by Punxsutawney Phil</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Punxsutawney Phil\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/yxt8-rUUosI&amp;t=157s\">https://youtu.be/yxt8-rUUosI&amp;t=157s</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn_.28Logarithmic_Manipulation.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn_(Logarithmic_Manipulation)\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn (Logarithmic Manipulation)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn (Logarithmic Manipulation)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/4_dUQu0a9ZA\">https://youtu.be/4_dUQu0a9ZA</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Hawk_Math\">Video Solution by Hawk Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Hawk Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VzwxbsuSQ80\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VzwxbsuSQ80</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/kuZXQYHycdk?t=925\">https://youtu.be/kuZXQYHycdk?t=925</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B\">2021 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki